===
title: Scene_End
tags: act3 end
---
Somewhere in the room, your son calls out to you.  
Prudence wails.  
Why is she wailing?  
It does not matter.


There is only one person you think of right now.


You recall what your mother told you when you were little:  
My child, a nightmare is but a reminder that the dark is unrelenting.  
It is our job to close our eyes each night and trust that God will wake us up.


You close your eyes.


<<stop>>
===


















